<title>USA: Swift Energy board adopts holder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Swift Energy board adopts holder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swift Energy Co said Friday that its board  had adopted a shareholder rights plan that would be triggered if anyone  acquires or tries to acquire 15 percent or more of its stock.</p>
<p>The plan was not adopted in response to any takeover effort, the company  said.</p>
<p>Rights to buy one one-thousandth of a share of a new Series A junior  participating preferred stock will be distributed as a dividend at  the rate of one right for each share held of record August 12, Swift  said.</p>
<p>Swift said the rights will expire July 31, 2007.</p>
</text>
